---
/**
 * Inline SVG icon sprite. Path geometry ported verbatim from the reference.
 *
 * Each icon is a <symbol viewBox="0 0 24 24"> — NOT a bare <g>. The viewBox is
 * load-bearing: it maps the 0–24 path coordinate space into whatever pixel size
 * the consuming <svg class="ico"> requests, so a 13px icon is the whole glyph
 * scaled down, not a cropped top-left corner. (The design reference used <g>
 * with no viewBox, which silently crops every icon — fixed here.)
 *
 * Rendered once per page in BaseLayout. Reference an icon with <Icon name="…" />.
 * Design law (_design-reference/README.md:141): inline SVG only — no emoji,
 * no icon font. 1.75 stroke, currentColor, round joins (set by .ico).
 */
---

